#: R/diagnosticmeta.b.R
msgid ""
"I² is not reported here: a univariate I² ignores the within-study "
"correlation between sensitivity and specificity and does not describe the "
"bivariate model (Zwinderman & Bossuyt 2008). The Heterogeneity Assessment "
"table reports Q, tau-squared and a univariate I² computed SEPARATELY for "
"sensitivity and for specificity - read those as descriptive summaries of "
"each margin, not as the heterogeneity of the bivariate model. For a "
"model-consistent statement of how much studies differ, use the prediction "
"interval above and the prediction region on the SROC plot."
