"Tumor response was categorized using SIMPLIFIED threshold-based criteria "
"adapted from RECIST v1.1 (NOT full RECIST-compliant). Categories based on "
"percent change thresholds: CR ≤-100%, PR ≤-30%, SD >-30% to <+20%, PD ≥+20%. "
"This analysis does NOT include target lesion summation, new lesion "
"detection, non-target assessment, or confirmation requirements mandated by "
"RECIST v1.1. Response rates calculated with exact binomial confidence "
"intervals."
msgstr ""

#: R/waterfall.b.R
msgid "Tumor shrinkage cannot exceed 100% (complete disappearance)."
msgstr "Tümör küçülmesi %100'ü aşamaz (tamamen kaybolma)."

#: R/swimmerplot.b.R
#: R/waterfall.b.R
msgid ""
"Two Fisher's exact tests (ORR and DCR) are reported with unadjusted "
"p-values; interpret them jointly rather than as independent evidence."
msgstr ""
"İki Fisher kesin testi (ORR ve DCR) düzeltilmemiş p-değerleriyle "
"raporlanmaktadır; bunları bağımsız kanıtlar olarak değil birlikte yorumlayın."

#: R/diagnosticmeta.b.R
msgid ""
"Two separate UNIVARIATE meta-regression models were fitted (logit "
"sensitivity and logit specificity), not a joint bivariate meta-regression, "
"using %s estimation with the Knapp-Hartung adjustment (test statistics are "
"t, not z)."
msgstr ""
"Ortak bir iki değişkenli meta-regresyon yerine, Knapp-Hartung düzeltmesiyle "
"%s tahmini kullanılarak iki ayrı TEK DEĞİŞKENLİ meta-regresyon modeli (logit "
"duyarlılık ve logit özgüllük) uyarlanmıştır (test istatistikleri z değil "
"t'dir)."

#: R/diagnosticmeta.b.R
msgid ""
"Two separate UNIVARIATE meta-regression models were fitted (logit "
"sensitivity and logit specificity), not a joint bivariate meta-regression, "
